\section{Plot Generation}

Plots for the DiffusionDB workload mirror v4's figure set (width-consistent bar
charts, throughput--latency scatter, latency-by-steps lines) plus the
v4-vs-v6 overlay figures in Chapter~5 and the standalone model-switching
figure sets in Chapter~6 (v4 and v5 equivalents, generated from v6's own
data).  All plots are written to
\texttt{results/model\_benchmark/plot\_data\_baseline/plots/} by the scripts in
\texttt{src/plots/}.

